  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "以茶代酒  (A Toast With Tea to a New Agency)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xin_huimei": "辛惠美"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Meeting fellow singer Bai Yang for tea after ending her contract with Yuanye Records, Xin Huimei explains why she turned down Bai Yang's agency and shares where she is heading next. Listen to Huimei's Mandarin lines first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我最近挺好的，不用担心我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "还好啦，原野是老东家，我也不想太伤他们。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "过了几天没有经纪公司的日子，我还上瘾了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "至于你说的那家公司，我不会签他们的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你已经是你们公司的一姐了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "这个公司虽然资源够多，平台也够大。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "可是想要同时养活咱们姐俩两个人，他们胃口也太大了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我现在还没正式签约，不过快了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我打算去东海。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "来吧，咱们以茶代酒，谢谢你的祝福！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我最近挺好的，不用担心我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have been doing pretty well lately; do not worry about me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "还好啦，原野是老东家，我也不想太伤他们。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is alright; Yuanye is my former label, and I did not want to hurt them too badly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "过了几天没有经纪公司的日子，我还上瘾了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'After spending a few days without a talent agency, I have actually grown quite fond of it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "至于你说的那家公司，我不会签他们的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'As for the agency you mentioned, I am not going to sign with them.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你已经是你们公司的一姐了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are already the top female artist at your agency.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "这个公司虽然资源够多，平台也够大。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Although that company has plenty of resources and a big enough platform.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "可是想要同时养活咱们姐俩两个人，他们胃口也太大了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wanting to support the two of us sisters at the same time shows too big an appetite.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我现在还没正式签约，不过快了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have not formally signed a contract yet, though it will be soon.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我打算去东海。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I plan to join Donghai.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "来吧，咱们以茶代酒，谢谢你的祝福！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Come on, let us toast with tea instead of wine; thank you for your good wishes!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我最近挺好的，不用担心我。",
